sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR/Manager
    participant View as "Web View (admin.schedules.create)"
    participant C as WorkerShiftController
    participant Svc as WorkerShiftService
    participant WS as "WorkerShift Model"
    participant WSH as "WorkerShiftHistory Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Isi form tambah jadwal (single/multi pegawai)
    View->>C: POST /admin/worker-shifts

    C->>C: Validasi request (worker, shift, tanggal, status)

    alt Data valid
        C->>Svc: create(payload per worker)
        Svc->>WSH: Log jadwal lama ke history (jika replace)
        WSH->>DB: INSERT worker_shift_histories (...)
        Svc->>WS: Hapus/nonaktifkan jadwal lama worker
        WS->>DB: DELETE/UPDATE worker_shifts lama
        Svc->>WS: Simpan jadwal baru
        WS->>DB: INSERT INTO worker_shifts (...)
        C-->>View: Redirect ke index + success
        View-->>Admin: Data jadwal baru tampil
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect back + errors + old input
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan validasi gagal
    end
